    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet within the exclusive and historic surroundings of Clarinda Park, this superb two-bedroom mid-terrace home in Clarinda Manor offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a property in one of Dún Laoghaire's most prestigious residential settings. Presented in great condition throughout, the home combines modern comfort with a sense of tranquillity, all within a small and private development. The setting is further enhanced by access to the park's well-known public tennis courts, adding a unique lifestyle benefit to this already appealing address.\n\nInside, the property is bright and well-maintained, offering comfortable accommodation ideally suited to a range of buyers. To the rear, a beautifully planted private garden enjoys a desirable west-facing orientation, capturing afternoon and evening sun—perfect for outdoor dining or relaxing in a peaceful, green setting. This charming outdoor space is a true highlight, providing both privacy and a connection to nature rarely found so close to the town centre.\n\nLocated in the heart of Dún Laoghaire, the property benefits from an abundance of local amenities including shops, cafés, schools, and excellent transport links. The vibrant seafront is just a short stroll away, offering scenic coastal walks and a host of leisure activities. Combining a prime central location with a quiet, leafy setting, this home presents a perfect balance of convenience and calm.\n\nKey Features:\n\n• Two-bedroom mid-terrace home in excellent condition\n• Located in a small, private development within Clarinda Park\n• Prestigious and historic residential setting\n• Beautifully planted, private rear garden\n• West-facing aspect for afternoon and evening sun\n• Access to public tennis courts within Clarinda Park\n• Prime central location in Dún Laoghaire\n• Close to a wide range of amenities\n• Short stroll to the seafront"
      },
